MODULE: comments
FILES: src/app/api/posts/[id]/comments/route.ts, src/app/api/comments/route.ts, src/app/api/comments/[id]/route.ts, src/components/comment-form.tsx, src/components/comment-list.tsx, src/app/admin/(admin)/comments/page.tsx
RESPONSIBILITY: reader comment system — public comment submission and display, admin comment moderation with status management
DEPENDENCIES:
- uses: @prisma/client: database ORM for comment queries
- imports: next-auth: session validation for admin API routes
- imports: src/lib/prisma: Prisma client singleton

INTERFACES:
- GET /api/posts/[id]/comments: list approved comments for a post (public)
- POST /api/posts/[id]/comments: submit comment with PENDING status (public, rate-limited)
- GET /api/comments: list all comments with status filtering (admin, auth required)
- PATCH /api/comments/[id]: update comment status (admin, auth required)
- DELETE /api/comments/[id]: delete comment (admin, auth required)
- CommentForm: client component with name/email/content validation
- CommentList: client component with relative time display

TRAPS:
- [HIGH] Next.js dynamic route params must use same segment name — [id] and [postId] at same level causes build error | FIX: use [id] consistently
- [LOW] In-memory rate limit store (Map) resets on server restart — acceptable for single-instance dev | FIX: use Redis or DB-backed store for production

CHANGELOG:
- F-005 | add: comment system with public submission and admin moderation
